Z||000017||Songman||04-10-2001||05:46 PM||||Sheesh! Did I hit a nerve somewhere or what? Never expected all of that. Not like I called you a name or anything. Just said that you ahd been misinformed...<P>Go look up the word 'MONOPOLY' in the SEC rule book. You'll see why Microsoft does not own Apple.<P>And at that, I am off of this thread... And we thought religion, politics, and race is where people would get offended! heheh<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||6
Z||000018||JSocha||04-10-2001||05:57 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Songman:<BR><B>Sheesh! Did I hit a nerve somewhere or what? Never expected all of that. Not like I called you a name or anything. Just said that you ahd been misinformed...<P>Go look up the word 'MONOPOLY' in the SEC rule book. You'll see why Microsoft does not own Apple.<P>And at that, I am off of this thread... And we thought religion, politics, and race is where people would get offended! heheh<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Songman!<P>If you were commenting on my note directly to you and the "good" feedback you gave to me, chill...everythings cool  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/cool.gif">.  Really did appreciate your feedback and assisting me on getting my facts straight, even if it has taken somebody several months to do so and a forum in which it could be done.<P>If your commenting on the other contraversies(sp?) recently listed...well, you just have to guess its gonna be a b*tch one way or the other on whos right and whos wrong and the "topic of discussion".<P>Does it really matter as the guy that started this topical thread, as he just recently stated, was wondering who else was using MAC's versus PC's and didn't expect it to end up like this.<P>I think we are just keepin it here at the top of this forum's list.<P>Just wondering Songman...are we cool?  Hope so!  Nobody's gotten on my bad side yet and I certainly hope the flip side holds true as well from me.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fiero5a_3.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000019||Songman||04-10-2001||09:00 PM||||JSocha,<P>Stick around and get to know me. You'll find that I don't have a 'bad' side. I like everybody! <P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||7
Z||000020||JSocha||04-10-2001||10:16 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Songman:<BR><B>JSocha,<P>Stick around and get to know me. You'll find that I don't have a 'bad' side. I like everybody! <P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Cool...Real cool...Songman...Real cool. <P>And I think I'll be here for a long time unless someone else out there black lists me like Insurance companies did to the Fiero's way back when, specially 1988 when I was going to purchase a brand new '88 Black GT fully loaded w/T's.<P>Songman, as well as you others out there readin this, don't take any sarcastic remarks, comments (or some of the "journal" entires) I tend to make seriously.  I'm really laid back.  Hope to get to know you all soon.<P>Later everyone.||||reg||1
